WEBVTT

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:05.280
Move it or I'll beat the crap out of you!

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:09.140
No! GO AWAY!

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:13.620
Humans eating other humans?

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:15.590
What a sick joke.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:19.290
