00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.430
But Takagi-san...

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.470
In this...

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:46.420
In this situation...

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:50.250
I have a question.

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:51.830
Wh-What is it?

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.910
Do you wanna die? Or do you wanna live?

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:58.410
Uhm, well...

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:04.250
See, there're some people standing outside the office who had the same idea as you. {there're -A0}

