Come on...

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:10.360
Takashi, I'm begging you...

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:15.010
I want to die as myself.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:16.910
He isn't going to...

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:19.470
He isn't going to turn into one of them!

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:20.830
Stop!

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:31.940
What is it?

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:35.890
Well, I want to know what's really going on.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:37.310
That was blunt.

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:39.310
Why would I lie?

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:54.090
Can I see your phone? I wanna try calling my dad.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:59.120
I know he's a cop, but how are you gonna contact him when even the police emergency line is busy?

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:03.940
He gave me a private number that I'm not normally supposed to use. {reworded for flow -A0}

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:08.610
I got through!

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:09.490
Dad?

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:10.180
Hello?

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.060
This phone number... Takashi-kun's?

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:13.960
Dad?

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:15.950
Listen Dad, we're at school right now...

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:21.030
Call Duration

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:21.030
Call Duration

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.160
Hello? Is this Takashi-kun?

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:17.790
Rei must've given you this number.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.260
Is she okay?

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:20.670
My connection...

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:23.710
Dad?! You can't hear my voice?!

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:26.830
Listen, this whole city is in a state of panic.

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:27.630
Dad? Dad!

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:28.190
You need to—

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:30.460
Okay?

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:32.430
This whole city is in a state of panic!

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:33.770
You need to get out ASAP—

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.420
Out of Range

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.420
Out of Range

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.420
End of Call

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.420
End of Call

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:38.710
Out of range?

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:41.430
But I just got through!

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:43.590
Why? Why?!

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:44.290
Rei!

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:48.890
Takashi...

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:50.840
Dad...

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:57.270
Didn't even know it was me...

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:05.110
T-Takagi-san, do you happen to have your cell phone on you? It's against the rules, but—

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:06.770
I'm an honors student!

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:10.220
Who would I even call if I had mine?

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:12.850
Uh, well, there's always the police...

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:14.840
You really are stupid.

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:16.450
Just look at how bad this uproar has gotten.

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:18.740
Don't you think someone's tried to call the cops already?

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.680
We haven't heard a siren yet, have we?

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:24.270
Do you get it now?

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:27.260
Is the whole city in an uproar?

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:28.460
Probably.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:30.770
The police have probably been dispatched already.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:32.320
But just look at this place...

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:35.210
Should we call like... the SDF?

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:36.940
I wouldn't count on them either.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:39.480
I know that without orders from the government,

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.450
they can't be dispatched for
defense or public security, but—

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:43.810
I'm not talking about that!

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.300
Then what're you—

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:48.160
They're in the same situation as the police.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:52.960
Let's say that people all over Japan are eating each other. What do you think is going on?

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:56.880
Listen, there're 130 million people in Japan. {there're -A0}

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:59.900
Of that 130 million, how many do you think are with the SDF?

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:04.300
Furthermore, who's to say that this hasn't affected the SDF?

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:08.900
Let's get out of here.

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:11.180
O-Okay!

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:15.630
<i>Sigh, I'm stuck with fatass here since Komuro ran off.</i>

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:17.760
<i>What a drag.{i think "drag" works better with her calling him a "fatass" (hurr durr his weight) instead of "lol i'm unlucky"}</i>

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.360
Nurse's Office

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:20.320
O-Okada...

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:24.890
Okada?

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:31.420
Crap!

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:32.380
Sorry!

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:32.920
Sorry!

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:37.340
Sorry! Sorry!

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:38.720
Whatever shall I do?

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.240
Sorry! Sorry!

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:41.090
Sorry! Sorry!

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.260
I'M SORRY!

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:45.790
I can't get a hold of the police or the fire department.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:49.240
I could treat people, but they're screwed once they get bitten,

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:51.340
and they come back to life after they die.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.990
I feel like I'm in one of those movies that weirdos like.

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:57.600
Is it really that amazing?{that you have to stop and ponder it}

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.480
Let's go, Shizuka-sensei!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.320
Hold on a sec.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.430
I should take whatever I can carry.

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:05.150
Please hurry!

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:09.730
Shizuka-sensei!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:13.170
Shizuka-sensei!

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:14.950
Run away! Quickly!

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:19.860
Uhhhh... What'd you say your name was again?

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:21.100
Huh?

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.090
H-Hey now...

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:49.440
I am Busujima Saeko, captain of the Kendo Club.

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:52.220
Tell me, 2nd year, what is your name?

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:55.920
Ishii... Kazu...

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:01.250
Ishii-kun, you fought bravely to protect Dr. Marikawa.

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:04.080
Your courage is nothing short of praiseworthy.

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:07.790
Do you know what happens to you once you have been bitten?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.030
Do you wish for your parents or friends to witness you like that?

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:12.750
If you do not,

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:15.710
then I shall end your life for you here and now.

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:18.070
Though, it would be my first time killing another.

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:22.390
P-Please...

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:25.650
W-Wait a sec, what—

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.600
I recognize that you are the school
nurse, but I request you not interfere.

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:33.540
One of our duties as women is to protect a man's pride.

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:00.590
What do we do now that we're here, Takagi-san?

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:03.000
Some of it does look useful, but—

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.440
Shut up, you fat nerd.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:07.230
Lock the door so they don't come in here!

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:09.930
I-It's locked!

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:12.870
Are we going to use these as weapons?

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:17.650
You're one of those so-called military nerds or gun freaks, aren't you?

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:22.100
Haven't you seen an action movie with one of these?

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:24.200
A nail gun?

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:26.030
It's gas powered?

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.440
Well duh!

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:30.930
You wouldn't be able to carry it around if it had 
a compressor like in the movies, would you?

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.610
Jeez, so stupid.

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:35.460
Do you like movies?

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:36.940
Don't be so stupid!

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:39.690
I'm an all-knowing genius!

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:43.820
We have an extra gas canister and extra nails here.

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:46.410
Nothing to worry about.

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:48.790
How could you not be worried?

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:50.280
They're coming!

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:51.540
They're coming from the hallway!

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:55.050
I'd say it weighs 9 lbs.{lit: 4 kg}

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:56.940
On par with an older assault rifle.

00:09:57.540 --> 00:10:01.110
But my stance will be messed up. It needs a sight.

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:03.190
Hey, are you ignoring me?!

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:09.810
Hirano?

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:18.760
No!

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:24.380
Gotcha!

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:26.250
Hirano?

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:29.610
Ready?

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:30.740
Ready!

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:32.740
Turn it on!

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:39.740
Aw crap.

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:47.650
Could you put the drill and nails over there in a bag?

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:49.330
Excuse me?!

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:51.880
Who gave you of all people the right to order me around?!

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:55.840
Please~?

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.410
Oookay.

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:01.650
Takashi!

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:03.430
It's okay.

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:06.750
They sound happy to see us.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:10.150
You all feel great, don't you?

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.050
Take this!

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:21.830
What do you think you're doing? You should carry something too.

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:28.130
H-Hey, Takagi-san... Mind if I ask you something?

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:29.470
What?

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:32.620
Erm, why me?

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:35.640
No reason in particular.

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:40.000
Oh, okay...

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:45.140
What's with the sudden mood swing?

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:47.510
Did you come to a realization?

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:50.500
I don't know, I guess I did!{"yet I do know" to ", I guess I did" for flow -A0}

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:52.420
Hirano!

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:53.230
Yes'm!

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:04.860
Gotta hand it to you. It was a good idea to use the fire hose.

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:08.010
Well, the water pressure is so strong.

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:12.290
Don't you remember when we were in middle school and we had that fire drill and you and Hisashi...

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:17.940
I'll be sure to remember it this time.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:22.900
I think I'm ready to go now.

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:27.240
It'll be rough in there. You sure?

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:37.220
Let's go.

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:56.810
Where are we going?

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:00.250
Home.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:04.610
We'll head to our houses and help survivors along the way.

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:08.530
This is our hometown. We should be able to feel our way around.{hmm, we're all playing on our home turf?}

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:10.950
Yeah!

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:12.800
I know my dad is safe, so...

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:16.370
Hey, you should call your house soon.

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:18.230
I will sooner or later.

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:20.710
My dad lives away from home because of his job,

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:23.780
and my mom is an elementary school teacher, so she wouldn't be at home either.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.460
They probably wouldn't shut up if I got a hold of them anyway.

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:30.410
Jeez, we shouldn't be laughing right now.

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:37.710
<i>I wasn't being serious about that, of course.</i>

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:41.370
<i>When I looked at how things were at my own school,</i>

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:46.730
<i>it frightened me to think of what it was like at my mom's school.</i>

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:02.000
Wh-What're you doing?

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:03.550
Shut up and watch.

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:11.960
Do you understand now?

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:14.980
See how he didn't react when that rag hit him?

00:14:15.590 --> 00:14:18.740
They don't feel pain so they only react to sound.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:23.850
I don't think they can see or he
wouldn't have run into that locker.

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:25.190
What about, say, heat?

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:27.500
We'll try it if we have to.

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:29.080
Let's move.

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:31.460
Are we really gonna go outside?

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:32.930
What's wrong with that?

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:36.100
Uhm, I don't like walking...

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.140
This is why I hate fat nerds!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:41.220
I don't wanna hear you complain about
walking until you're old enough to drive!

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:56.370
The staff room? What a difficult request you have made.

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:59.920
But everyone keeps their car keys in there...

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:08.300
Hey, why don't you just kill them? It should be easy for you...

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:10.830
Stopping to crush the head of everything we come across

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:12.880
would accomplish nothing
other than to slow us down. {"would be no different than 
restricting ourselves from movement" reworded for flow -A0}

