00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:35.730
Takagi-san!

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:37.580
Go away...

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:39.620
Go away!

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:54.850
GO AWAY!

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:11.520
I'm sick of these things! I want my mom!

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:15.540
I will take the right!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:16.370
Rei!

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:17.970
